{
  "$comment": "Cross-validator conformance corpus — the shared floor of manifest rules. Consumed by cortex-registry (scripts/conformance.mjs), cortex-app-template (scripts/conformance.mjs), and cortex-app (tests/test_manifest_conformance.py). A rule change that reaches only one implementation fails the others' CI. Only include rules ALL THREE enforce; 'mention' is a substring that must appear (case-insensitive) in every implementation's error output.",
